          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"sera-lab\">Sera Lab</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Pick an open-weight model and press <strong>Run</strong>. Sera's specialist agents\npropose one configuration change at a time, each trial is measured, and\nanything that breaks the latency target or the quality floor is reverted\nand recorded as such.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The code below is the code that runs. Nothing here is a mockup.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
