 0.994 against a 0.975 floor&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003c/li&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003c/ul&#92;u003e&#92;n&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eA faster candidate existed and was rejected: &#92;u003ccode&#92;u003eweight_dtype=int4, kv_cache_dtype=fp8&#92;u003c/code&#92;u003e reached 1,790 ms but scored 0.943 against a 0.975 floor, so it was reverted.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;success&quot;'></marimo-callout-output>"
